@startuml Git Hooks Overview
!theme plain

title Git Hooks - Simple Overview

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

' Components
package "Git Hooks System" {

  [pre-commit] as PreCommit #LightBlue
  [post-commit] as PostCommit #LightGreen
  [SessionEnd] as SessionEnd #LightYellow

  note right of PreCommit
    **Triggers:** Before commit
    **Purpose:** Branch protection
    **Action:** Block commits to main/master
  end note

  note right of PostCommit
    **Triggers:** After commit
    **Purpose:** Auto-sync documentation
    **Action:** Sync .usecase/cases/ to hub
  end note

  note right of SessionEnd
    **Triggers:** Claude Code session ends
    **Purpose:** Capture statistics
    **Action:** Save session metadata
  end note
}

' Flow diagram
actor Developer
cloud "Git Repository" as Git
database "Use Case Hub" as Hub
database "Session Stats" as Stats

Developer -> PreCommit: 1. git commit
PreCommit -> Git: 2. Validate branch ✓
Git -> PostCommit: 3. Commit created
PostCommit -> Hub: 4. Auto-sync docs
Developer -> SessionEnd: 5. End Claude session
SessionEnd -> Stats: 6. Save statistics

' Legend
legend right
  **Three Independent Hooks:**

  **1. pre-commit** - Enforces branch workflow
  **2. post-commit** - Syncs documentation
  **3. SessionEnd** - Tracks AI sessions

  **Installation:**
  Run: ./scripts/project/setup-project.sh

  **Locations:**
  • .git/hooks/ (git hooks)
  • .claude/hooks/ (Claude Code hooks)
  • .usecase/session-stats/ (statistics)
endlegend

@enduml
